<!--
  <sui-tree-item> — SUI port of <ship-tree-node>. Co-located with <sui-tree-view>.
  Expandable hierarchical list item with keyboard focus management.

  Prop / event parity vs <ship-tree-node>
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Lit                         SUI                         Notes
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  label (string, '')          label (string, '', reflect) ✓
  expanded (bool, false)      expanded (bool, reflect)    ✓
  selected (bool, false)      selected (bool, reflect)    ✓
  leaf (bool, false)          leaf (bool, reflect)        ✓
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ship-toggle → {expanded}    sui-toggle → {expanded}     event renamed
  ship-select → {}            sui-select → {}             event renamed
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  role=treeitem set via       controller sets on host     ✓
    connectedCallback
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Keyboard: Enter/Space→select; ArrowRight→expand; ArrowLeft→collapse     ✓
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Slots: (default) nested items, icon (leading), trailing
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Parts: row, caret, label, children
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  NEW SURFACE (re-port from feat/next, parity-gate pass)
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  - No tone prop — rule "tone is global now" doesn't apply.
  - The row is the L1 layout keyword row (gap/align attributes), not a
    hand-styled flex div; its padding/radius/cursor/ink move to sx
    (py:1 px:2 radius:sm cursor:pointer fg:foreground). The `:host([selected])
    .row { background; color; font-weight }` rule becomes a real variants
    block (below the props) targeting part=row, selected: bg:selected-bg
    fg:foreground weight:medium — sx/variants both close over the exact same
    3 declarations, so this one moved cleanly, unlike sui-tree's row (see
    that component's re-port note: descendant data-* state can't move).
  - The caret's fixed 12x12 box also moved to sx (w:3 h:3 — --space-3 is
    12px, an exact match) plus its ink (fg:muted-foreground); its
    rotate-on-expanded transform has no sx channel and stays raw (documented
    in the residual note below).
  - Restored this header comment, which the prior pass had dropped entirely
    (no functional loss — the parity table above is unchanged from feat/next
    — but the gate wants anatomy/parity noted, and a blank header isn't that).
  - Dropped a dead line the prior pass added: a bare (outside any selector,
    inert in real CSS) list of every token this residual references, each
    given an EMPTY value, purportedly so "the css-token lint recognizes"
    them. Unnecessary — every name in it (--foreground, --hover-bg,
    --selected-bg, --background, --ring, --ring-offset, --ring-width,
    --space-1/2/3, --radius-sm, --muted-foreground, --font-weight-medium,
    --text-xs, --border-subtle, --duration-fast, --ease-out) is already a
    real, registered global token; the lint never needed help. Not in
    feat/next; removed rather than re-ported.
  - Anatomy (light DOM, class-based — part= left on per the wave sweep note):
    row.row (part=row, the clickable treeitem row) > span.caret (chevron
    svg) + slot[name=icon] + span.label + span.trailing (slot[name=trailing]);
    sibling div.children (part=children, role=group) holds nested
    sui-tree-item recursion or the default slot.

  Residual style (unchanged rationale from the prior pass): :host base +
  [hidden], .row :hover + the stacked focus-ring box-shadow (two box-shadows
  of different widths — the 2-layer offset ring that mirrors the sx ring:
  model's emission but expressed here as a state-specific raw value), the
  forced-colors media query, the caret's rotate-on-expanded transform (no sx
  channel) + leaf visibility, .label's flex/ellipsis, .trailing's size/color,
  .children's indent/border/padding + the not-expanded display:none — all
  either pseudo-classes, transforms, or descendant selectors sx/variants
  can't reach.
-->

<prop name="label" type="string" default="" reflect />
<prop name="expanded" type="bool" default="false" reflect />
<prop name="selected" type="bool" default="false" reflect />
<prop name="leaf" type="bool" default="false" reflect />

<variants part="row">
  selected:  bg:selected-bg fg:foreground weight:medium
</variants>

<style>
  :host { display: block; }
  :host([hidden]) { display: none; }

  .row { transition: background-color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out); }
  .row:hover { background: var(--hover-bg); }
  .row:focus-visible {
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 var(--ring-offset) var(--background),
      0 0 0 calc(var(--ring-offset) + var(--ring-width)) var(--ring);
  }
  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .row:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid CanvasText; outline-offset: 2px; }
  }

  .caret { transition: transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out); }
  :host([expanded]) .caret { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  :host([leaf]) .caret { visibility: hidden; }

  .label {
    flex: 1; min-width: 0;
    white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .trailing { margin-inline-start: auto; color: var(--muted-foreground); font-size: var(--text-xs); }

  .children {
    margin-inline-start: var(--space-2);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-3);
  }
  :host(:not([expanded])) .children { display: none; }
</style>

<row class="row" part="row" gap="2" align="center" tabindex="0" bind:this={rowEl}
  sx="
    py:1
    px:2
    radius:sm
    cursor:pointer
    fg:foreground
  "
>
  <span class="caret" part="caret" aria-hidden="true"
    sx="display:inline-flex w:3 h:3 fg:muted-foreground"
  >
    <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
      <polyline points="4 3 8 6 4 9"></polyline>
    </svg>
  </span>
  <slot name="icon"></slot>
  <span class="label" part="label">{nodeLabel()}</span>
  <span class="trailing"><slot name="trailing"></slot></span>
</row>
<div class="children" part="children" role="group">
  {#if nodeChildren().length > 0}
    {#for c of nodeChildren() key={c.id}}
      <sui-tree-item prop:node={c}></sui-tree-item>
    {/for}
  {:else}
    <slot></slot>
  {/if}
</div>
